{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly your Cosmic Cat to their comfy green cat to complete each level.\u00a0 There are a total 186 levels filled with a wide variety of challenges.\u00a0 These are split up into a main campaign (120 levels), a bonus campaign called Cosmic Kitten (60 levels), and 6 additional seasonal themed levels plus cats to unlock that will appear each season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/ff57ee68899d52ba61a4ccf7f6d3c894.poster.avif?t=1773217457\" width=426 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/ff57ee68899d52ba61a4ccf7f6d3c894.webm?t=1773217457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120 Unique Collectable Cards:\u00a0 For you level explorers out there, each main level has a collectable card based on a something in the game.  They will be easy to find in the beginning but will become harder to find later in secret areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/06aa3684a8b49b1b250c19bb5d6e5573.poster.avif?t=1773217457\" width=426 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/06aa3684a8b49b1b250c19bb5d6e5573.webm?t=1773217457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Gold Stars\u00a0 \u2192\u00a0 Unlock Playable Cats:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing a level fast enough and you'll be rewarded a Gold Star, which will randomly unlock one of 120 playable Cosmic Cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Silver Stars\u00a0 \u2192\u00a0 Arcade Coins:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish a level at a decent pace and you'll be rewarded a Silver Star, you'll be rewarded with an Arcade Coin, which you can save up to spend to unlock 5 different arcade minigames (Cat Flap, Cat Walker, Catcher, Catapult and Cats Eye) and also an extra 60 levels in the 2nd campaign (Cosmic Kitten).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Bronze Stars\u00a0 \u2192\u00a0 Progression:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't want to race against the clock, you can switch off or ignore the timer and take as long as you want and you can still earn a Bronze Star which unlocks the next level until you complete the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/fc30e3ba5c98d3b91f66b2a96f60d316.avif?t=1773217457\" width=800 height=449 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist and Follow Cosmic Cat to get ready for the launch!</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Kitchen Basics","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3873550/a7903218eb450f34ec5e29853f954b92eede4bb9.jpg"},{"name":"Garage Gateways","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3873550/63609df497e67cba7fb368607a53a2ea79f26983.jpg"},{"name":"Caravan Capers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3873550/2141b1fd8119219fc568e287b8095da20d504dba.jpg"},{"name":"Garden Gauntlet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3873550/18dd9a44f32aafdf4da15a206c18718c7e18b179.jpg"},{"name":"Backroom Boosters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3873550/dc68c34886a9c31c7c7246f3e84f3f3f66e94a38.jp