 Catcher, Catapult and Cats Eye) and also an extra 60 levels in the 2nd campaign (Cosmic Kitten).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Bronze Stars\u00a0 \u2192\u00a0 Progression:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't want to race against the clock, you can switch off or ignore the timer and take as long as you want and you can still earn a Bronze Star which unlocks the next level until you complete the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/fc30e3ba5c98d3b91f66b2a96f60d316.avif?t=1773217457\" width=800 height=449 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist and Follow Cosmic Cat to get ready for the launch!</h2>","developers":["theSoulGrinder"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/a4c68154f95ad4abe1288493a32c7f00a792f048/header.jpg?t=1773217457","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3873550/1350003704/ec265db4408128761a9ff40a1c1d3d9aec091a3d/1752374448/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752679037","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3873550/1350003704/ec265db4408128761a9ff40a1c1d3d9aec091a3d/1752374448/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752679037","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3873550/1350003704/ec265db4408128761a9ff40a1c1d3d9aec091a3d/1752374448/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752679037","id":257168274,